  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sikasso Regional Council - Technical Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Technical Assistance (TA) to the Regional Council (RC) of Sikasso is part of the second development commitment &quot;Technical and financial support to the Regional Council of Sikasso&quot; and aims at the following two objectives:
-	Strengthen the capacities of the Regional Council in the management of Regional Economic Development (DER), and more specifically in the areas of leadership, planning, monitoring and evaluation for the DER, administration, coordination and communication;
-	Support the Sikasso Regional council  in the implementation of DANIDA&apos;s support, as defined in the 2017-2022 Development Commitment.</narrative>
  </description>
